# The exact denial each document in storage-iscsi-persistent-volume.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both.
PersistentVolume storage-iscsi-source uses volume source iscsi, which is not an enumerated local means
